+/// The phase profile of a run, as `--json` writes it: one number per phase, in the order the phases
+/// ran.
+///
+/// An object built from `Phase::ALL` rather than seven named fields, because the phases are one list
+/// and a struct would spell them a second time: a profile whose keys were written out by hand here
+/// is a profile that drifts from the one the harness prints
+/// (`lakelet/4.15-budget-regression`). The order is the phases' own — a `BTreeMap` would answer with
